'''Windy Station''' (Japanese: '''風の駅''' ''Wind Station'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in [[Unova]]. It is one of the settings of ''[[M15|Kyurem VS. The Sword of Justice]]''.

It is a station on the train line to [[Roshan City]], and the train stops here for exactly three minutes. Travelers can rush out to buy {{p|Darumaka}} {{wp|Bento|boxed lunches}}, {{b|Oran}} Ice, and other goods to enjoy from [[Malin]]'s stall. Other than the several buildings on its platform, the station appears to be isolated.

While {{Ash}} and {{ashfr}} were on their way to Roshan City, they made use of the three-minute-long stop to buy a large supply of the Darumaka boxed lunches.

